Package: usb4-rdma-provider
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libibverbs1, iproute2
Maintainer: AppMana <ops@appmana.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AppMana/forks-thunderbolt
Description: ALPHA tbrxe libibverbs userspace provider
 Drop-in libibverbs provider for the Thunderbolt/USB4 RDMA engine. The tbrxe
 provider binds thunderbolt_frame_rxe kernel devices through the rxe uverbs
 ABI under a private driver id, coexisting with the distribution's librxe.
 Install alongside the matching thunderbolt-frame-dkms package for full
 ibv_devices visibility and downstream RDMA tool support. The package also
 carries stable per-link netdev naming and deterministic per-link ULA address
 tooling. This build is alpha/pre-release software.
